{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/4/fb4fd5b1926f9772de7a9c2479dcc08a1f279ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b,c]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> to mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e92b291f31d8b1de02097934d5013b0a968f4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {a+b}c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"42\" height=\"37\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5061ac0ea7f3b0c9eb6387005ae6c28eac6bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />. What is the value of \n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2cf272c97594ab2ba19c593e6899385689f28e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[[60,30,90],[2,1,3],[10,5,15]\\right]?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"240\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dada2b1d51e75a9836f40d012c034e7ef265ce79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }0.5 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }1.5 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"370\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/8/ce8ca90fee4369bbae5459b8d8a30fa6986f1d3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ta,tb,tc] = \\frac{ta+tb}{tc} = \\frac{t(a+b)}{tc} = \\frac{a+b}{c} = [a,b,c]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"382\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78f8c2c9a63b9a15b4faa387f8bdc0c554f6a041.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[60,30,90] = [2,1,3] = [10,5,15] = \\frac{2+1}{3} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"355\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/c/b7caca0a409964a0551df75dcc64ae7af6e0bee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[1,1,1] = \\frac{1+1}{1} = 2 \\Longrightarrow \\mathbf{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"221\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td wi